{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25842","headline":"臯桥 · 李绅","name":"臯桥","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"伯鸾憔悴甘飘寓，非向嚣尘隐姓名。\n鸿鹄羽毛终有志，素丝琴瑟自谐声。\n故桥秋月无家照，古井寒泉见底清。\n犹有余风未磨灭，至今乡里重和鸣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李绅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25842.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25842","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}